 "official_summary": " <p><b>21st Century President Act</b></p> <p>This act revises the definition of <em>immediate family</em> for purposes of a criminal offense involving a threat to kill, kidnap, or inflict bodily harm on a former President or a member of the immediate family of a former President.</p> <p>Specifically, it replaces gender-specific references to a former President's <em>wife</em> and <em>widow</em> with the gender-neutral terms <em>spouse</em> and <em>surviving spouse</em>.</p>",
